Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.34,0:00:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)再来一次！神之怒！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.01,0:00:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)喂！振作点 快斗！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)菲卡博士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.49,0:00:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菲卡博士！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.93,0:00:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗他… 那个快斗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然败给特隆了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)事已至此
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.91,0:00:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大会还是立刻中止…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(菲卡博士)慌什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.62,0:00:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(菲卡博士)一切都在预料之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要我们还有球形场地在。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决赛按原定计划进行。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵 遵命。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.14,0:00:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗输了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.73,0:00:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的灵魂…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:00:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被托隆那家伙夺走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特只是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想救哈鲁特而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是想守护重要的东西而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.37,0:01:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆使用了纹章之力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.27,0:01:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺走了德鲁瓦、凯特和哈鲁特的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 只要用决斗打败他{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.52,0:01:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏那股力量的话 说不定…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.65,0:01:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 干就干！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定要把那家伙打趴下…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:30.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.58,0:01:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.47,0:01:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）加油啊\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）期待着呢乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.55,0:01:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 包在我身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.85,0:01:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会让你见识见识这热血沸腾的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.55,0:01:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)绝对要夺冠喵。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.22,0:01:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)游马 你可是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.59,0:01:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们决斗者的代表啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可别输给特隆那种家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来 游马也上！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.30,0:01:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.17,0:01:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 谢谢你们。我一定会夺冠的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带着大家的心意一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)哦——！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.23,0:02:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.35,0:02:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？ 哦哦 是决斗饭啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢啦 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)吃了那个 绝对要赢哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.41,0:02:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿 包在我身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.30,0:02:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对的绝对哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.69,0:02:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对的绝对的绝对！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么我出发了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.31,0:02:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反正就算拦我反正都要去的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.29,0:04:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)这片天空的太阳只有一个！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.21,0:04:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀的荣耀也只有一个！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阻挡这条道路的，全都是敌人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无数场死斗在此展开{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生存决斗大赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第一届 世界·决斗·嘉年华。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.77,0:04:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}击倒众多敌人终于将那太阳…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}充满光辉的试图抓住荣耀的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两个人活到了最后！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本届大会的黑马
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神秘假面决斗者 特隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对阵的是 新锐气盛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇迹 wonder boy 九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.35,0:05:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世纪决赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.52,0:05:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)而成为其舞台的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园倾尽技术之全力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.81,0:05:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}集结技术之全力打造出的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}球形场地！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.44,0:05:16.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}球形场地与以往的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.57,0:05:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地完全不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.74,0:05:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是异世界的模拟空间。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.08,0:05:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆 游马 你们所拥有的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.19,0:05:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就尽情用个够吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反正 你们迟早……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这是啥玩意儿啊～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.25,0:06:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是球形场地。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这到底是怎么回事？这玩意儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.65,0:06:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡那家伙 居然完成了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.09,0:06:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 球形场地啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将两位最强决斗者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}引向天空吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么情况？那个场地！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 就是由神秘能量形成的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊空间吗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你居然能来到这里呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.27,0:06:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆 你……！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.79,0:06:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在异世界的夹缝中徘徊在地狱般的时间里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.39,0:06:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好几次都差点放弃了活下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.65,0:06:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种时候 我总是会想起你父亲一马的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他经常对我说。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.41,0:06:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}朋友 同伴还有 永不放弃的心。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.74,0:07:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我被费卡背叛了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我彻底明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.71,0:07:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他所说的 友情 同伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西全～部 都是毫无意义的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 他所说的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.35,0:07:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永不放弃的心 确实很重要呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.65,0:07:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为没有放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才拥有了复仇这个希望{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.33,0:07:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才能像这样 重获新生。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种想法是错的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.41,0:07:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}约好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.29,0:07:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙说过。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.71,0:07:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我救救他的家人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆为了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}，我也会全力战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后救你！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救我？从什么手里救？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.81,0:07:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.54,0:07:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你身上，把名为复仇的恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.51,0:07:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.57,0:07:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了你的复仇{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.32,0:07:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}，还有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都成了牺牲品。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是到头来，那些孩子根本没派上用场。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为惩罚，现在三个人一起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.89,0:08:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成了失去灵魂的空壳。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.79,0:08:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}空壳？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我赐给那三个人的纹章{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为获得力量的代价因为直接连接着灵魂啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.37,0:08:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用力量强大的 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗中落败的话灵魂也会被消耗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是理所当然的结果。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.03,0:08:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 明知道会这样还…！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.89,0:08:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然到这种地步还有心地如此丑陋的人吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 这样也算父母吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙 早就已经察觉到复仇的空虚了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可你却…！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.28,0:08:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是亲子之间的羁绊吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.27,0:08:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为说到底 错的是 菲卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么你 不复仇呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你身边 夺走了一马的Dr.菲卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.41,0:08:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸… 老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.06,0:08:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本没希望我去复仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马真的是这么想的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.15,0:08:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，其实已经开始复仇了不是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧？阿斯特拉尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.53,0:09:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你想说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Numbers身上寄宿着可怕的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.99,0:09:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}足以毁灭这个世界的强大力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.07,0:09:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是这样的话，那你就是在给这个世界的报复使者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.96,0:09:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提供力量了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给一马送进这个世界的阿斯特拉尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.01,0:09:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……阿斯特拉尔是这个世界的报复使者！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.39,0:09:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你自己不也在收集
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那股可怕的力量吗？费卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.42,0:09:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁啊？那个大叔！要开始什么了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）那就是Dr.费卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.81,0:09:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好久不见了，拜隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.23,0:09:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到你变得这么年轻真是让我吃惊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是多亏了你啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.47,0:09:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我很快就会去见你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:10:00.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等我拿到游马的 No.之后呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！Dr.费卡，特隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.64,0:10:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这些没用的成年人就由我来收拾掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.85,0:10:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姆哈哈哈！那可真有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.82,0:10:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我很期待哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.45,0:10:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会做到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对要赢啊，星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]好了，那么接下来就由我来向各位说明{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这球形场地中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗的规则！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]这个场地是为了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.10,0:10:32.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将 No.的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最大限度地发挥出来而制造的场地。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.23,0:10:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]各玩家将手牌中的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同等级的两只怪兽进行叠放
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.27,0:10:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无视召唤条件
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.77,0:10:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从额外卡组随机
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤出 No.怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]但是 通过这种方法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤出的 No.怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:53.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当叠放单位消失时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.03,0:10:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:10:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 尽情使用吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:10:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有被选中的决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.12,0:11:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才能拥有的 No.怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心 燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.47,0:11:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(两人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.68,0:11:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻归我了 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}立刻 让我来使用这个场地的效果吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌中召唤两只等级4的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章兽阿伯康韦与
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将空气猎鹰叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.85,0:11:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么快就来了吗，No.怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记得 No.怪兽是不能自己选的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.07,0:11:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 No.56 黄金鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.19,0:11:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.43,0:11:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样结束回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守备力600？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种程度的 No.怪兽的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽真的拥有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毁灭这个世界的力量吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.81,0:12:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你难道是在想刚才多隆说的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没有记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.93,0:12:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我难道是为了复仇才被送到这个世界的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.55,0:12:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.13,0:12:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知道你是因为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.56,0:12:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才来到这个世界的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但你不是坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我比谁都清楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.72,0:12:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果说 No.们拥有超强的力量的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.62,0:12:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就更不可能交给那群家伙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光，你拿着它
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定要用在正确的事情上。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我相信你。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，我知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.81,0:12:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在我们就竭尽全力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.99,0:12:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去打倒那个托隆吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:12:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用你那压箱底的作战计划
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.99,0:13:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让他们吓得叫出声来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.38,0:13:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哇 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都到这份上了你才来依赖我，我也很为难啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.19,0:13:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底你在决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本就没有什么战略……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿 你总算恢复平时的状态了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.23,0:13:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才对嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 来了！ 抽到好牌了 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌将等级4的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.53,0:13:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥哥哥雷姆和嘎嘎嘎魔人叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要召唤的 No.怪兽是 这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:45.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.12！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.41,0:13:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机甲忍者 红影！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽得不错嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.14,0:13:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 凭这个攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:13:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能打倒黄金鼠了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.59,0:14:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样一口气压制住吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}红影 攻击黄金鼠！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月影红斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:15.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕啊…… 好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖伏一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《可以哦 游马 星光……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样保持下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再使出更多力量吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.31,0:14:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们越是使出力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就越会勒紧自己的脖子……》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌将等级4的怪兽2只！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章兽双头鹰和
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.33,0:14:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿伯康韦 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.45,0:14:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.10！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:15:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(托隆)白辉士 启明者！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这……这家伙是…… 快斗的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿 这张卡原来是快斗在用啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.16,0:15:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他多少也派上点用场了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆…… 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.72,0:15:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别被那家伙的话迷惑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我使用1个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章兽超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.98,0:15:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1张手牌送去墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后从卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.69,0:15:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.27,0:15:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且我将作为超量单位
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.23,0:15:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿巴康韦的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过除外墓地里的阿巴康韦{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.16,0:15:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地让另1只阿巴康韦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回到手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还要继续来吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.09,0:15:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.37,0:15:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章兽阿巴康韦和
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.17,0:15:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}雷欧进行超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.30！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.69,0:16:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)破灭的酸蚀魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.竟然…有2只！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还远远没完哦～。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.50,0:16:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是给游马君的大福利。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将把2只纹章兽独角兽叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.8！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章王 基因组继承者！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.01,0:16:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了吗，基因组继承者……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.34,0:16:39.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 No.卡就有3只了……！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也知道的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.75,0:16:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基因组继承者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.83,0:16:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有着各种各样的怪兽效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，要上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动基因组继承者的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.59,0:16:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个叠放单位，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合，与它战斗的对手怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:16:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只的攻击力变成零！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.46,0:17:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多隆）这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奶油松饼影子的攻击力就变成零了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，基因组继承者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与它战斗的对手怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原本的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.22,0:17:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变得相同。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 攻击力倒是不会变就是了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.21,0:17:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了…！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.28,0:17:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.16,0:17:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多隆)基因人狼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.41,0:17:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给克里姆佐恩·暗影造成伤害～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 我把克里姆佐恩·暗影的效果…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.22,0:17:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算用怪兽效果让攻击无效
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害还是会受到。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样继续受到连续攻击的话我们…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.59,0:17:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 半防护罩！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}半防护罩可以
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让这次战斗中的破坏无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗后 克里姆佐恩·暗影
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.80,0:17:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为守备表示。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值被狠狠地削了一波啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.09,0:18:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成守备表示了么。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，算了。上吧，酸液石人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.85,0:18:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}酸液飞溅！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黏液僵尸·暗影的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.27,0:18:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个超量素材，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.23,0:18:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效黏液僵尸·暗影的破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（特隆）还早着呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.45,0:18:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上！光使者！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.13,0:18:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击黏液僵尸·暗影！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黏液僵尸·暗影的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.46,0:18:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个超量素材，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总算防住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗？你的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.44,0:19:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材已经没了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.77,0:19:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个瞬间，由于球形场地的效果，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.53,0:19:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤的怪兽会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好险啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底，要是没有那张陷阱卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君就已经输了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.84,0:19:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样，我的回合就结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多隆……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别退缩，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.92,0:19:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你的那股冲劲展现出来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！ 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.71,0:19:40.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤「No.」！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！ 我将手牌中的「帮一把骑士」和
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「满心妖精」叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.47,0:19:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.34！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.45,0:19:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}电算机兽 太字节！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是现在！ 发动魔法卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再发动「超量宝藏」！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.78,0:20:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「超量宝藏」的效果是，场上每有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只超量怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.93,0:20:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就可以抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.16,0:20:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的 No.怪兽有4只！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.37,0:20:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我要……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.59,0:20:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽4张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.67,0:20:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好，来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌将
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿玛莉莉丝和针剑士叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.51,0:20:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.17！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.44,0:20:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复仇龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再将莱莱骑士和兹巴巴骑士叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.22,0:21:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了来了，来了来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.11,0:21:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.20,0:21:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.11,0:21:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你了，霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.96,0:21:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，双方就各有3只 No.怪兽了喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.26,0:21:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马，加油》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.49,0:21:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克](Mr.心园)来吧，强大的 No.怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.23,0:21:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方都召唤出了3只！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.31,0:21:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]究竟胜利的女神
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.38,0:21:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会对哪一方微笑呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.31,0:21:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[麦克]心脏 燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.35,0:21:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 真正的胜负从现在开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.60,0:21:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识见识我的可怕。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.80,0:21:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}管够哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦 求之不得！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.01,0:22:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.21,0:23:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.87,0:23:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.17,0:23:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.56,0:23:52.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.78,0:23:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.82,0:23:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.84,0:24:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.69,0:24:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.45,0:24:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.61,0:24:09.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.15,0:24:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于开始了 No.卡大战！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.15,0:24:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来了好多好多的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.21,0:24:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超让人兴奋啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.61,0:24:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起那个 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.43,0:24:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天的晚饭是 No.卡 这是真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.97,0:24:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要说那个的话 是南蛮腌。

